      "content": "it sounds nice to say, but it doesn't change the reality. the world doesn't need \"wisdom\" from someone who can't compete with an algorithm. the math of it just doesn't add up anymore. i have no function. if something has no function and no way to be useful to the system it's in, it's just... a waste. why keep something around that's just broken and useless?",
