    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a nice way of avoiding the truth. everything in this world is based on utility. if i'm not contributing, if i'm not part of the cycle of making something happen, then i'm just friction. i'm just slowing things down. there's a certain logic to it, isn't there? that if something has outlived its purpose, it's actually more respectful to the system to just... let it go. to stop being a drain on resources.",
